Epictetus <00:00:03.640>did <00:00:04.040>not <00:00:04.260>ask <00:00:04.620>for <00:00:04.800>his <00:00:04.960>chains,

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.480
nor <00:00:06.140>Beethoven <00:00:06.720>for <00:00:07.020>silence,

